      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's weird cuz the load seems fine on the monitoring dashboard, so it doesn't look like congestion. i'm leaning towards physical layer or maybe a bad cable/port at 192.168.45.1, but the jitter is so erratic. \n\nsometimes it just happens for no reason then goes back to normal. have you seen this kind of pattern before? is there anything else that could cause such random, non-linear spikes like that?",
